# Noise into a tuned loop: held notes (velocity 1: no pluck; in the chord the newest note wins) turn the echo into a resonator; at
# P2 235 the loop rings on by itself (a drone), held by the saturator.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1
track fx1
input noise 0.1
param p1 136
param p2 200
param pan 200
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 A2 8 1
note 8 D3 8 1
note 16 C3 8 1
note 16 E3 8 1
note 16 G3 8 1
param p2 235 24
note 24 E2 16 1
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
